{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal multiprofile setup using pca_n2000 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion, comparing to config_030 (scvi_n200 with avgpool). Validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103 suggest the RNA encoder choice may influence performance, though the exact impact and role of other factors like aggregation remain uncertain."
}

